OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after fire at
OL,4,Aderelict Douglas flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire has caused significant
OL,7,Fdamage to a derelict block of flats in
OL,8,FDouglas which were scheduled to be
OL,9,Fdemolished.
OL,11,FFirefighters tackled the blaze at Sea
OL,12,FCourt, an empty building on Victoria
OL,13,FRoad, for a significant part of Sunday
OL,14,Fnight, with crews staying at the scene
OL,15,Finto the early hours of Monday.
OL,17,FNo-one was hurt, and police have asked
OL,18,Fanyone who witnessed the fire, or has
OL,19,Ffootage of it, to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
